 571:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h **** * @brief Stops the active data reception request.
 572:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * @param handle I2C_MASTER APP handle pointer of type @ref I2C_MASTER_t
 573:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * @return I2C_MASTER_STATUS_t status
 574:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
 575:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * \par<b>Description:</b><br>
 576:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * If a reception is in progress, it will be stopped. When a reception request
 577:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * is active, user will not be able to place a new receive request till the active
 578:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * reception is complete. This API can stop the progressing reception to make
 579:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * a new receive request.
 580:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
 581:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * Pre-requisite: Instantiate I2C_MASTER APP and generate code before using below code snippet.
 582:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
 583:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * Example Usage:
 584:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * @code
 585:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
