 885:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * receive FIFO is used for data reception. An interrupt is configured for reading received data fr
 886:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/I2C/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * function only registers a request to receive a number of data bytes from a USIC channel. If FIFO
